[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 23952.868, "timestamp": "06:39:12", "text": "。嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23960.31, "timestamp": "06:39:20", "text": "，我為什麼要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23965.11, "timestamp": "06:39:25", "text": "那樣做？  呃 [音樂] 珊瑚。哦，[音樂]真好聽。  呃，慢慢集中註意力。好的。謝謝。直接去那裡就行了。  ["}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23969.27, "timestamp": "06:39:29", "text": "音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23973.39, "timestamp": "06:39:33", "text": "糟糕。  哦。哦。  哦。這很好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23986.868, "timestamp": "06:39:46", "text": "哦。我需要這個……呃，這個底部。這兩個人三個，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23991.03, "timestamp": "06:39:51", "text": "我"}]